          "step": "3",
          "title": "CONNECTION TYPES",
          "text": "CONNECTION TYPES\r\nIn order to use the Rules Generator with Connection Grammars, the different connections\r\nare labeled with a specific Type (a single string without spaces) according to their specific\r\nposition on the part. Different organization of types might be used to separate between different\r\naggegation logics.",
          "nearby_components": [
